# Telemetry
- Telemetry is opt-in and configurable.
- Do not collect raw sensitive/user-entered values by default.
- Prefer redacted, hashed, categorical or structural metadata.
- Telemetry failures must not break component behavior.
- Sinks must be replaceable through explicit interfaces.
- Avoid global mutable state when runtime-scoped state is sufficient.
- Dispose listeners/subscriptions correctly.
- Public telemetry events require stable typed contracts.
